@host = http://localhost:8080

### Public Endpoints
### Basic request - must return .html file
GET {{host}}/index.html

###
### Basic /hello request - must return 200 + string
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello

### Role-based Endpoints: /admin
### No authorization - must return 403
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/admin

###
### User authorization - must return 403
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic user user

###
### Admin authorization - must return 200 and string
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin Co0l@dmin1337

### Role-based Endpoints: /user
### User authorization - must return 200 and string
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/user
Authorization: Basic user user

###
### Admin authorization - must return 403
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/user
Authorization: Basic admin Co0l@dmin1337

### Role-based Endpoints: /human
### User authorization - must return 200 and string
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/human
Authorization: Basic user user

###
### Admin authorization - must return 200 and string
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/human
Authorization: Basic admin Co0l@dmin1337

###
### No authorization - must return 403
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/human

### CRUD Operations
### No authorization - must return 403
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games
Accept: application/json

###
### User authorization - must return 200 and JSON
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

###
### Admin authorization - must return 200 and JSON
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic admin Co0l@dmin1337
Accept: application/json

###
### User authorization - must return 403
POST {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic user user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "name": "DOOM (1993)",
  "description": "The legendary FPS that made revolution in graphics and gaming industry at its time period.",
  "genre": "shooter"
}

###
### Admin authorization - must return 200
POST {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic admin Co0l@dmin1337
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "name": "DOOM (1993)",
  "description": "The legendary FPS that made revolution in graphics and gaming industry at its time period.",
  "genre": "shooter"
}

###
### User authorization - must return 403
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic user user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "Dead Cells: Return to Castlevania"
}

###
### Admin authorization - must return 200
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic admin Co0l@dmin1337
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "name": "Minecraft",
  "description": "The best selling videogame in history, released in 2011.",
  "genre": "sandbox"
}

###
### User authorization - must return 403
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/games/4
Authorization: Basic user user

###
### Admin authorization - must return 200
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/games/4
Authorization: Basic admin Co0l@dmin1337

### SuperAdmin requests - every one of them MUST return 200
### Superadmin: Access to /admin endpoint (ADMIN role)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

###
### Superadmin: Access to /user endpoint (USER role)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/user
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

###
### Superadmin: Access to /human endpoint (ADMIN / USER role)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games/hello/human
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

###
### Superadmin: Read games (GET)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

###
### Superadmin: Create game (POST)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "5",
  "name": "ULTRAKILL",
  "description": "MANKIND IS DEAD. BLOOD IS FUEL. HELL IS FULL.",
  "genre": "Retro FPS"
}

###
### Superadmin: Update game (PUT)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/games
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "5",
  "name": "Dead Cells",
  "description": "A pretty fun 2D roguelite-metroidvania",
  "genre": "Roguelite-metroidvania"
}

###
### Superadmin: Delete games (DELETE)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/games/5
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin
